            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-112318-libgssapi-krb5-2",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-112318 medium vulnerability for libgssapi-krb5-2 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The policy RPC stubs in kadmin/server/server_stubs.c in MIT Kerberos 5 (aka krb5) 1.5.3 and later do not reject a NULL policy name decoded by xdr_nullstring(), which allows remote authenticated users to cause a denial of service (kadmind crash via NULL pointer dereference) by sending a policy request with an empty policy name that reaches authorization checks or logging code."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-112318",
